  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://www.ms.dk/sites/default/files/publikationer/publications/2023/YiC%20SPA%20Case%20study%202023.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in Crises SPA II case study 2023</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people increasingly engage meaningfully in the Compact for Young People in
Humanitarian Action. ActionAid (AA) &amp; ActionAid Denmark (AADK) aims to increase the
inclusivity of the humanitarian sector and has ensured the participation of 40 young people
and 10 youth organisations in the Compact. After a youth-led organisation shared their
experience of the Ukraine response &#x2013; facilitated by AA/AADK &#x2013; at the YouthCompact annual
meeting 2022, the Compact established 4 new workstreams to support the youth efforts</narrative>
   </description>
